WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
[HW002 by ZPKT: the breakdown, no kick, building up]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
[The kick drops: hard, driving techno at 160 BPM]

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
[Driving techno continues]

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
[The kick is pulled back for two bars]

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[The kick slams back in]

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
[Peak: brighter hi-hats join the groove]

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
[The track's final hit rings out and fades]
